      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blair%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Amish farming families have settled in the area, and their horse-drawn carriages are sometimes seen on the roads around Blair.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
